The audit points toward a missing **decision procedure**, beyond requirements to comply, continue, and report honestly. I’m focusing the proposed rules on the choices that repeatedly went wrong: selecting the right target, preserving the requested mechanism, carrying corrections forward, and matching claims to evidence.

